msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:354
#: 154a1b8ae91945348ce9d1beb674b391
msgid ""
"Consider giving back to the Qubes community and helping other users "
"by :ref:`generating and submitting a Hardware Compatibility List (HCL) "
"report <user/hardware/how-to-use-the-hcl:generating and submitting new "
"reports>`."
